%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: CTP800BD 4x6 Calibration
%%Pages: 1
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 288 432
%%EndComments
<< /PageSize [288 432] >> setpagedevice
0 setgray
0.7 setlinewidth
12 12 264 408 rectstroke
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 19 scalefont setfont
24 391 moveto (CTP800BD) show
/Helvetica findfont 11 scalefont setfont
24 371 moveto (Linux USB + network driver) show
24 350 moveto (4 x 6 inches / 203 DPI) show
24 332 moveto (TOP - text should be upright) show
24 315 moveto (White background, black text) show
0.5 setlinewidth
24 286 moveto 96 286 lineto stroke
24 281 moveto 24 291 lineto stroke
96 281 moveto 96 291 lineto stroke
24 266 moveto (This line measures one inch.) show
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 12 scalefont setfont
24 236 moveto (Line detail) show
0 1 19 {
  /i exch def
  24 i 6 mul add 184 1 34 rectfill
} for
/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
24 164 moveto (Twenty separate vertical lines) show
24 141 moveto (Check that all four border edges print.) show
24 122 moveto (No shipping information on this test.) show
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 12 scalefont setfont
24 66 moveto (BOTTOM) show
/Helvetica findfont 9 scalefont setfont
24 44 moveto (notquiteog/ctp800bd-linux-driver) show
showpage
